and it doesn't come out

00:02:10.210 --> 00:02:11.807
that means it's ready, right?

00:02:12.041 --> 00:02:14.541
I could really (beeping)
myself over this morning.

00:02:16.980 --> 00:02:17.813
Whew.

00:02:17.813 --> 00:02:20.200
And I guess that just all
of it, it all goes in.

00:02:20.200 --> 00:02:21.883
We're not going any food coloring,

00:02:22.257 --> 00:02:23.320
these are just gonna be plain macarons.

00:02:23.320 --> 00:02:24.393
And now we fold.

00:02:24.400 --> 00:02:26.330
Don't over mix, don't under mix.

00:02:26.330 --> 00:02:28.844
We wanna get it to like
a ribbony consistency

00:02:28.844 --> 00:02:32.483
