it like holds it shape.

00:02:32.483 --> 00:02:34.807
Wow, these were very stiff peaks.

00:02:34.807 --> 00:02:36.700
I'm gonna go a little bit more.

00:02:36.700 --> 00:02:38.790
Yeah, that's kind of innate.

00:02:38.790 --> 00:02:40.623
I'm gonna stop mixing, I think we got it.

00:02:40.923 --> 00:02:41.756
