is completely missing

00:09:07.650 --> 00:09:09.994
the one white eye dot, so
I really only have one tray

00:09:09.994 --> 00:09:12.993
of viable macaron corgis.

00:09:13.030 --> 00:09:15.210
I think we got at least
one good one in there.

00:09:15.210 --> 00:09:16.809
I think they're done and
I'm gonna go get 'em.

00:09:16.809 --> 00:09:19.150
Uni-corgi!

00:09:19.150 --> 00:09:20.923
Man, I really hope they peel off.

00:09:23.960 --> 00:09:25.473
Oh, yeah.

00:09:26.712 --> 00:09:27.545
I'm really worried that bow tie

00:09:27.545 --> 00:09:29.393
just is completely gonna break off.

00:09:29.420 --> 00:09:30.913
And the horn.

00:09:30.936 --> 00:09:34.733
Please don't break, please
don't break, please don't break.

00:09:34.733 --> 00:09:36.193
Ahh, I'm squishing it.

00:09:37.767 --> 00:09:40.070
Hey.

00:09:40.070 --> 00:09:43.363
Uni-corgi, check it out.

00:09:43.433 --> 00:09:44.266
(squealing)

00:09:44.266 --> 00:09:46.150
I'm really surprised actually.

00:09:46.150 --> 00:09:48.510
All right, buttercream.

00:09:48.510 --> 00:09:49.343
Oh.

00:09:49.550 --> 00:09:50.383
Oh no.

00:09:50.580 --> 00:09:52.283
I shouldn't have put it in the fridge.

00:09:52.400 --> 00:09:53.470
Can I warm it up?

00:09:53.470 --> 00:09:54.303
Stand by.

00:09:54.666 --> 00:09:55.499
(soft music)

00:09:55.499 --> 00:09:56.480
my buttercream was too cold,

00:09:56.480 --> 00:09:59.011
I microwaved it 30 seconds
and it's nice and soft.

00:09:59.011 --> 00:10:00.510
These look like bellies.

00:10:00.510 --> 00:10:01.463
That wasn't great.

00:10:02.150 --> 00:10:04.868
Obviously not enough
frosting on that side.

00:10:04.868 --> 00:10:06.611
It looks like doggy poo.

00:10:06.611 --> 00:10:09.763
I think I did so good.

00:10:10.420 --> 00:10:12.350
One ear's way bigger than the other.

00:10:12.350 --> 00:10:14.260
The bow tie's a little bit blobby.

00:10:14.260 --> 00:10:15.900
But he's got a good unicorn horn

00:10:16.010 --> 00:10:17.210
and he's got a cute face.

00:10:17.210 --> 00:10:18.043
Let's tell Rie.

00:10:19.678 --> 00:10:20.511
- Oh!

00:10:20.511 --> 00:10:21.960
Did you go to the store and bought it?

00:10:21.960 --> 00:10:22.987
- No, I didn't!

00:10:23.284 --> 00:10:24.553
I made these.

00:10:25.534 --> 00:10:26.523
You didn't think I could do it.

00:10:26.900 --> 00:10:27.750
- To be honest...

00:10:27.977 --> 00:10:29.393
(laughing)

00:10:29.393 --> 00:10:30.233
- You can be honest now.

00:10:30.419 --> 00:10:32.373
- I'm so surprised.

00:10:33.218 --> 00:10:34.051
(laughing)

00:10:34.051 --> 00:10:34.884
Can I eat it?

00:10:34.884 --> 00:10:35.717
- Yeah, let's eat one.

00:10:36.258 --> 00:10:37.091
- Nose to nose.

00:10:37.337 --> 00:10:41.043
Nice, like, inside it's kinda chewy,

00:10:41.620 --> 00:10:42.853
outside it's crispy.

00:10:43.257 --> 00:10:44.361
- It's just so sweet.

00:10:44.361 --> 00:10:45.930
- Oh, good.
- Right?

00:10:45.930 --> 00:10:48.130
I did so good, no one
thought I could do it.

00:10:48.179 --> 00:10:49.590
(laughing)

00:10:49.590 --> 00:10:51.170
That's my favorite feeling.

00:10:51.170 --> 00:10:54.030
All right, so, I figured out
how to make a good macaron

00:10:54.030 --> 00:10:56.507
and I figured out how to pipe
them in the shape of corgis

00:10:56.507 --> 00:10:58.123
and get a good bake on them.

00:10:58.140 --> 00:10:59.990
Made a chocolate buttercream filling.

00:11:00.050 --> 00:11:02.320
I feel, this is the
closest I've ever gotten

00:11:02.320 --> 00:11:04.280
to like nailing a video.

00:11:04.280 --> 00:11:06.979
Took me two ays to be able to make three

00:11:06.979 --> 00:11:08.147
that look kind of okay.

00:11:08.147 --> 00:11:10.690
But the restaurant has
like tons of these to sell

00:11:10.690 --> 00:11:12.203
which is really, really cool.

00:11:12.220 --> 00:11:13.320
- I think you nailed it.

00:11:13.320 --> 00:11:14.920
Wow.
- I'm gonna put this

00:11:14.920 --> 00:11:15.883
on my resume.

00:11:16.230 --> 00:11:18.501
I can make uni-corgi macarons.

00:11:18.501 --> 00:11:20.918
(soft music)

00:11:24.630 --> 00:11:26.253
- [Man] Oh, yes.

00:11:27.739 --> 00:11:30.564
(camera shuttering)

00:11:30.564 --> 00:11:32.932
(soft music)

